{"municipality_code":"14108","pref":"神奈川県","city":"横浜市金沢区","headline":"村の境界の痕跡があるかもしれません。","display_comment_enriched":"横浜市金沢区には、江戸期の六浦藩と米倉陣屋跡に連なる領主・城下の記憶が残っています。 周辺には寺社や信仰の場、史跡や遺跡、古墳や貝塚にまつわる場所が点在し、「金沢文庫」、「米倉陣屋跡」、「富岡八幡宮」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では城跡・陣屋跡、史跡説明板が、地域の歴史を読み解く手がかりになるでしょう。 川沿いや水辺では、暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を伝える案内板、治水碑、河川改修の記念碑にも注目してみてください。 六浦藩にゆかりのある領主碑や旧領境のしるべも、現地で探してみたい歴史の手がかりです。 ゆかりの人物では苅田久徳や若林忠志に注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":40,"rank":922,"percentile":50.8,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":174,"rank":85,"percentile":95.4,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":23,"rank":1082,"percentile":40.8,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":13,"rank":601,"percentile":64.6,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":6,"rank":685,"percentile":59.2,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":4,"rank":933,"percentile":43.7,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":7,"rank":1278,"percentile":30.1,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":